OL,4,BBayern hold 'constructive' talks over  
OL,5,BMusiala's health                       
OL,6,GBayern Munich are only focused on      
OL,7,Ggetting Jamal Musiala back from injury 
OL,8,Gand are not interested in the comments 
OL,9,Gmade regarding his contract, the       
OL,10,Gclub's sporting director Max Eberl     
OL,11,Ginsisted.                              
OL,13,FThe 23-year-old collapsed twice in     
OL,14,Ffour days during pre-season and said   
OL,15,Fhe had been diagnosed with "easily     
OL,16,Ftreatable absence seizures, which are  
OL,17,Fdue to a neurological dysfunction".    
